{
  "description": "A Markdown with a NUL byte and a non-ASCII letter is UTF-8, as in the Tika 4.2.0 oracle (tikajs-zms6)",
  "tags": [
    "repro",
    "encoding",
    "markdown"
  ],
  "input": {
    "base64": "SGVsbG8gzqkgeAB5Cg==",
    "filename": "t.md"
  },
  "assertions": [
